        <item>
            <title>2.0.4</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 09:35:04 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20004</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>MotionUI 2.0.4</h2>
<ul>
  <li>You can create a rectangle right from the panel again, under More → Rectangle. Width, height and corner radius stay live sliders in Effect Controls, so you can animate them. The corner radius slider now goes up to 500 px.</li>
  <li>New Liquid glass switch for the rectangle. It bends and frosts whatever lies below it and adds three soft white inner shadows. Refraction, depth, frost, tint and every shadow stay live controls on the rectangle, and the glass follows when you animate its size, corners, position or rotation.</li>
  <li>Claude and Codex can build the same liquid glass rectangle for you.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
